[32m+[m[32m### How I Learn[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mI am not a textbook-only learner.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mI learn best by understanding a concept, attempting to implement it, making mistakes, finding out why something failed, improving it, and trying again.[m
